  "fullDescription": "Color Bubble is a bold and bubbly display font that radiates fun, creativity, and kid-friendly energy. With its thick, rounded letters and playful curves, this font is perfect for children’s designs, party invitations, classroom materials, stickers, coloring books, and any project that calls for a cheerful, cartoonish vibe.\n\nDesigned to pop off the page, Color Bubble pairs beautifully with vibrant palettes and whimsical layouts. Its bold presence and smooth edges make it easy to read, while the soft, dynamic outlines bring a sense of movement and fun.\n\nWhether you’re crafting for print or digital, Color Bubble will add a joyful and animated personality to your work.",
